DESCRIPTION:SUP Yoga on the Petaluma River\, “Petaluma’s Longest Park
 ” Step away from the rush and into the quiet of the Petaluma River for a
  peaceful SUP Yoga experience with The Floathouse Petaluma . #block-5deab2
