DESCRIPTION:Learn to SUP: Build Skills. Find Flow. Ready to feel confident
  on a paddleboard? Our Learn to SUP class is a welcoming\, two-hour introd
 uction designed to help you paddle smarter — not harder — so you can t
 ruly enjoy your time on the water. Start your SUP journey on the calm Peta
 luma River. For just $60 \, you’ll learn from an ACA-certified (American
  Canoe Association) instructor in a small\, supportive group of just 2–6
  students . That means personalized attention\, real feedback\, and space 
 to grow. We’ll cover: Proper stance and balance Efficient paddle techniq
 ue Turning and maneuvering Launching and returning to the dock River aware
 ness and safety basics #block-8ca7d258561c01d66507 { --stroke-style: none\
