 sqs-html-content { } } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { } Everyone
 ’s welcome to this all-levels community class! Sometimes there’s free 
 music from basin businesses on shore\, too! The vibe is all-inclusive! Joi
 n us for Free Community Yoga on The Floathouse Dock \, an all-levels class
  that flows right along with Friday nights in downtown Petaluma. As the ci
 ty eases into the evening—and sometimes live music drifts through the ai
 r—this outdoor practice invites you to move\, stretch\, and be part of t
 he moment. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778182357513_2596 { --stroke-style: none\;
